      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْلَسَتْ</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a camel) <i>produced her young
one before the completion of the days:</i> (T, K:)
the epithet applied to her in this case is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْلِسٌ</span></b> ;
and to the young one, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْلَسٌ</span></b> , (TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَسٌ</span></b> .
(Ibn-'Abbád, TA.) ― 
